{
  "about": [
    "The conformance files in conformance/ (and the case-folding table the Agent Reputations package carries) are copies of the Common Agent Standards' own. Each entry names the copy here, the file it copies in the repository below, the tag, and the SHA-256 of that file at that tag (LF line endings).",
    "tools/check-standards-pin.mjs holds every copy to its pin, and with --remote checks each pin against the file at its tag."
  ],
